---
import FAQ from "./FAQ.astro";

const items = [
  {
    question: "Does VariantLens modify my theme code?",
    answer: "No. VariantLens runs through the app embed and does not require you to manually edit your theme code.",
  },
  {
    question: "Can I test VariantLens before using it across my catalogue?",
    answer: "Yes. The Free plan lets you use VariantLens on one active storefront product at a time, so you can test it properly before expanding.",
  },
  {
    question: "Can I change or reorder assignments later?",
    answer: "Yes. You can update which images belong to each variant and change their order whenever you need.",
  },
  {
    question: "What happens if my theme behaves differently from a standard Shopify theme?",
    answer: "VariantLens checks whether it can safely enhance the gallery first. If it cannot, it leaves the native gallery available rather than risking a broken product page.",
  },
  {
    question: "What happens if I uninstall VariantLens?",
    answer: "Your Shopify product media remains in place. VariantLens does not remove your original product images from Shopify.",
  },
  {
    question: "Will VariantLens slow down my product page?",
    answer: "VariantLens is designed to stay lightweight and only take over the gallery when it can do so safely.",
  },
];
---

<section class="faq-section section white">
  <div class="shell faq-section__layout">
    <div class="faq-section__intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
      <h2>What merchants need to know.</h2>
      <p>Still unsure? Here are the things merchants ask most before installing.</p>
    </div>
    <FAQ items={items} />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-section { padding-block: 88px; }

  .faq-section__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(250px, 360px) minmax(0, 680px);
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: start;
    gap: 72px;
  }

  .faq-section__intro { max-width: 350px; }

  .faq-section__intro h2 {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.3vw, 2.85rem);
  }

  .faq-section__intro > p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .faq-section { padding-block: 70px; }
    .faq-section__layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 38px; }
    .faq-section__intro { max-width: 560px; }
  }
</style>
